Comment: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:17.97,OP,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:44.32,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Every day's unique, you get one chance at it
Comment: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:46.38,OP,,0,0,0,kara,So you'd better make it count
Comment: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:49.31,OP,,0,0,0,kara,When people flaunt morality
Comment: 0,0:01:49.55,0:01:53.02,OP,,0,0,0,kara,You've gotta beware they've got their own agenda
Comment: 0,0:01:53.16,0:01:55.96,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Somewhere in your head, there's a voice that's messin' with ya
Comment: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:57.96,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Don't ever let it turn you 'round
Comment: 0,0:01:58.21,0:02:01.65,OP,,0,0,0,kara,It can't even blow all that hot air it's full of
Comment: 0,0:02:01.85,0:02:04.59,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Get yourself in gear and live however you wanna
Comment: 0,0:02:04.73,0:02:09.63,OP,,0,0,0,kara,Live so fast that the claws of despair will languish in your dust
Comment: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:13.65,OP,,0,0,0,kara,And you'll be the one with an agenda that they'll all see as just
Comment: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:18.47,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,Keep on shouldering the world around you
Comment: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:21.21,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,Keep on doubting every thought that's bound you
Comment: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:23.14,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,If things go awry, keep pushing through
Comment: 0,0:02:23.14,0:02:25.99,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,And know that everything'll work in the end
Comment: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:30.03,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,If you find it's in your power to change the world
Comment: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:32.71,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,I'm sure you can make the future bright
Comment: 0,0:02:32.95,0:02:36.89,OP,chors,0,0,0,kara,We'll blaze on ahead until we track down the route we want to take
Comment: 0,0:02:38.87,0:02:42.56,OP,,0,0,0,kara,We'll keep trying every door until we find one that goes our way
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.61,0:00:11.03,Main,,0,0,0,,You want to know why Prince Leon was chosen as Pride's fiancé, is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.79,0:00:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Anemone does have\N a second and a third prince; however...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.98,0:00:23.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I spoke with them directly, and thought only Prince Leon seemed suited to her.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.36,0:00:29.67,Main,,0,0,0,,The King of Anemone wished for this as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.50,0:00:34.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That explanation just doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.69,0:00:38.31,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, Stale.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.92,0:00:41.36,Main,,0,0,0,,As per your earlier request,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.36,0:00:45.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I will allow you to apprentice under Vest\N beginning a week from now.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.34,0:00:53.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I'm going to study with Uncle Vest,\N I'll have practically no time to be with Pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.51,0:01:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if that makes me more of a benefit\N to Pride and our citizens in the future, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.75,0:01:06.74,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I... no longer need to stay by her side.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.72,0:02:52.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stale, are you finished speaking with Mother?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.65,0:03:00.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.69,0:03:03.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm just a little tired.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.89,0:03:08.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Elder Sister...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.17,0:03:11.77,Main,,0,0,0,,She's sleeping?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.45,0:03:15.33,Main,,0,0,0,,She said she hardly slept last night.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.26,0:03:17.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Last night?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.30,0:03:25.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Rest here with us, Stale.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.26,0:03:27.31,Main,,0,0,0,,To be honest...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.88,0:03:31.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been really lonely these past three days.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.26,0:03:35.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I felt like Prince Leon had taken my sister away.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.40,0:03:41.51,Main,,0,0,0,,But then Pride invited me to the gardens,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.51,0:03:44.12,Main,,0,0,0,,and she hugged me with everything she had.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.28,0:03:51.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I think she noticed that I was feeling lonely\Nand did it to comfort me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.84,0:03:55.69,Main,,0,0,0,,But then, she told me...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.69,0:03:57.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Stale?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.84,0:04:00.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.85,0:04:06.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Stale...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.12,0:04:09.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I missed you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.22,0:04:14.23,Main,,0,0,0,,She told me that, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.42,0:04:29.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I've missed you as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.62,0:04:34.43,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's okay, I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.72,0:04:40.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even when we're apart, my heart will always be with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.18,0:04:43.99,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if I'm not next to you,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.80,0:04:48.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}even if you fall in love with that man...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.76,0:04:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I still belong to you, body and soul.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.43,0:05:03.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Arthur!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.44,0:05:09.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess Pride?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.28,0:05:14.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad that I didn't miss you passing through!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.80,0:05:19.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got horrible bags under your eyes! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.72,0:05:21.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.97,0:05:23.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I surprised you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.33,0:05:24.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.90,0:05:26.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.13,0:05:28.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.04,0:05:32.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I apologize for not speaking with you yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.09,0:05:35.33,Main,,0,0,0,,You forced yourself to escort us\N even though you didn't feel well, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.63,0:05:39.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess Pride!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.86,0:05:41.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.45,0:05:44.32,Main,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to ask you...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.00,0:05:49.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Are...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.10,0:05:52.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you happy?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.46,0:05:55.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.03,0:05:58.53,Main,,0,0,0,,After all, I have you and everyone else with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.53,0:06:06.13,Main,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.13,0:06:08.57,Main,,0,0,0,,So you weren't just grinning and bearing it, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.57,0:06:09.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.17,0:06:10.89,Main,,0,0,0,,My apologies, that was rude of m—
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.16,0:06:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be silly!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.82,0:06:20.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Arthur?! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.26,0:06:24.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, let me worry about you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.22,0:06:29.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you have that fake smile inside the carriage?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.80,0:06:32.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you putting up a front?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.59,0:06:35.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Does he have some sort of dirt on you or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this all for the country?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.04,0:06:44.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Stale, Tiara, and I are all worried about you,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.36,0:06:47.78,Main,,0,0,0,,and yet you seem so, so far away...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.65,0:06:49.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.37,0:06:54.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Arthur. And you two, as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.81,0:06:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful that you worry about me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.81,0:07:01.06,Main,,0,0,0,,However, I'm truly fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.92,0:07:04.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay, it's just as I thought.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.13,0:07:09.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter how hard this is for her,\Nshe's dead set on taking it on all on her own.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.92,0:07:17.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like she feels it's her destiny to be a lone wolf or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.80,0:07:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.98,0:07:22.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}protect her smile.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.76,0:07:27.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be by your side...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.97,0:07:28.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.95,0:07:32.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.87,0:07:42.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If the man chosen as her partner is one that she likes,\Nthen I will continue to protect their happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.11,0:07:51.12,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he turns out not to be the one,\Nthen I will protect Pride from him
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.69,0:07:54.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and take care of her in his place.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.44,0:07:57.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing will change.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.97,0:08:05.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because I've long since dedicated everything to Princess Pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.88,0:08:11.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother, I've had a premonition!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.56,0:08:16.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I must go, for the sake of the people!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.04,0:08:20.80,Main,,0,0,0,,To our allied nation, the Kingdom of Anemone!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.72,0:08:30.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Arthur! Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.15,0:08:33.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Arthur, how are you feeling?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.70,0:08:35.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.80,0:08:38.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I made you worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.06,0:08:42.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you heard about your assignment from the Captain?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.65,0:08:43.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.56,0:08:46.21,Main,,0,0,0,,On the day of, well...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.82,0:08:49.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I believe I'll be causing you a lot of trouble, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.97,0:08:51.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I do appreciate your assistance.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.68,0:08:52.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.57,0:08:54.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.22,0:08:58.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What in the world are you going to Anemone to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.26,0:09:00.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.67,0:09:03.31,Main,,0,0,0,,There's nothing dangerous going on this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.79,0:09:06.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Then you must have some other reason for going, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.57,0:09:12.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it's probably nothing.{TLC "If it turns out to be nothing at all"}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.83,0:09:14.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Just think of it as a visit—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.01,0:09:15.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "probably nothing"?{TLC: "what would turn out to be nothing?"}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.26,0:09:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What has you so concerned?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.64,0:09:24.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Does it have something to do with\Nwhat you've been hiding from us?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.85,0:09:26.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.20,0:09:29.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm still powerless, and there's nothing I can do to help.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.21,0:09:33.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not even asking to accompany you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.41,0:09:38.23,Main,,0,0,0,,But I can still offer emotional support.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.14,0:09:43.60,Main,,0,0,0,,If you won't share because you find us untrustworthy, then so be it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.10,0:09:44.81,Main,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.67,0:09:47.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I doubt that's the case.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.84,0:09:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I know you better than that.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.44,0:09:56.06,Main,,0,0,0,,We're willing to believe everything you have to say.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.06,0:09:58.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if it's merely hypothetical.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.25,0:10:05.48,Main,,0,0,0,,And rest assured, none of us will fault you\Nif things don't turn out as you expect.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.34,0:10:11.13,Main,,0,0,0,,If you see fit to trust us, then please tell us what's on your mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.49,0:10:13.94,Main,,0,0,0,,At least just a little bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.92,0:10:33.78,Main,,0,0,0,,You are more stunning than even the stars in the sky\Nwhen you're bathed in moonlight, Pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.03,0:10:38.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I think we should come together as one tonight, right here.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.26,0:10:50.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.92,0:10:55.80,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want to be intimate with me,\N then I'm fine with that.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.52,0:10:59.09,Main,,0,0,0,,We are engaged to be married, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.11,0:11:16.99,Main,,0,0,0,,However, that is not what your heart truly desires.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.64,0:11:20.63,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't something our relationship needs.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.12,0:11:24.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.78,0:11:29.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You've performed very well these past three days.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.92,0:11:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyone would agree that you had\N the demeanor of the perfect fiancé.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.88,0:11:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.54,0:11:40.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to perform in front of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.83,0:11:46.58,Main,,0,0,0,,There is no need to lie to yourself\N and pretend there is love here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.58,0:11:49.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand completely.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.52,0:11:51.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.65,0:11:54.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, make me a promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.33,0:11:59.52,Main,,0,0,0,,In exchange, I will keep tonight's events to myself,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.52,0:12:04.35,Main,,0,0,0,,and return to playing\N the happy couple with you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.35,0:12:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Just who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.84,0:12:17.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I am the first-born princess\N of the Kingdom of Freesia, Pride Royal Ivy.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.84,0:12:22.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I am first in line to the throne,\Nand I have the special ability of precognition.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.47,0:12:29.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I am the only person in this world\N who knows your true desires.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.22,0:12:34.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, Prince Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.97,0:12:41.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You absolutely must not leave your castle\N for an entire week after you return to your country.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.59,0:12:44.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Not even to check around.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.08,0:12:45.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Especially on the last day.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.62,0:12:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That is when you will lose everything.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.74,0:12:53.09,Main,,0,0,0,,The trust of your people and even the king.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.84,0:12:55.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, keep this promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.48,0:13:01.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't explain now,\Nbut all of this is for what you truly desire.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.40,0:13:05.39,Main,,0,0,0,,This is for your happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.73,0:13:14.65,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, I gave Prince Leon a warning, but I'm still worried.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.65,0:13:16.35,Main,,0,0,0,,If things go wrong, I want to...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.35,0:13:17.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.82,0:13:25.15,Main,,0,0,0,,In short, last night in Prince Leon's room, uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.15,0:13:29.11,Main,,0,0,0,,you did nothing but talk, and then left?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.11,0:13:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.71,0:13:36.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll skip the part about how Leon made a pass at me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.96,0:13:44.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyways, I want to—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.51,0:13:45.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.26,0:13:48.22,Main,,0,0,0,,So this top-secret visit is to ensure
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.22,0:13:52.64,Main,,0,0,0,,that Prince Leon doesn't leave the castle\N and realize your premonition, correct?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.89,0:13:57.20,Main,,0,0,0,,That's agreeable enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.20,0:14:02.11,Main,,0,0,0,,In any event, if he really does leave the castle,\Nwe can secretly track him down,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.11,0:14:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,act before he's found\N by Anemone's guards, and detain him—
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.93,0:14:09.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, protect him.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.95,0:14:13.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Such disgraceful behavior from Prince Leon
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.17,0:14:16.25,Main,,0,0,0,,would only be a black mark\N on both our kingdom and on Anemone!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.64,0:14:17.81,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.81,0:14:23.04,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to set the record straight on some things,\Nbut Stale's tongue is way too sharp!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.64,Main,,0,0,0,,That's all it was, seriously?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.72,0:14:27.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I had imagined so much worse...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.60,0:14:31.64,Main,,0,0,0,,U-Um, I'm truly sorry that I worried you!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.64,0:14:36.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Ugh, my impression of the situation\N was way off the mark.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.25,0:14:38.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I even dragged Stale into it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.78,0:14:41.55,Main,,0,0,0,,But that only made you worry about us instead!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.96,0:14:44.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Man, how pathetic!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.26,0:14:46.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, Stale.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.40,0:14:47.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.41,0:14:49.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I think what I told you only made things worse...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.42,0:14:54.36,Main,,0,0,0,,See, Elder Sister?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.36,0:14:56.54,Main,,0,0,0,,They weren't angry with you at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.54,0:14:57.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.60,0:15:03.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Arthur.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.97,0:15:07.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I didn't give you a proper answer\N when you asked me before.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.62,0:15:12.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Arthur.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.80,0:15:16.10,Main,,0,0,0,,You noticed right away that I was having a hard time.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.58,0:15:19.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You even said you'd stay by my side.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.04,0:15:21.73,Main,,0,0,0,,It made me so happy!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.30,0:15:28.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Please promise, Pride,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.81,0:15:32.34,Main,,0,0,0,,that you'll rely on us next time.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.34,0:15:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Whether you need our help or not.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.52,0:15:36.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Let us share the burden.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.58,0:15:41.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.28,0:15:48.56,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a bad habit of yours, sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.56,0:15:51.35,Main,,0,0,0,,You mustn't take on everything on your own.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.60,0:15:53.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We're all here for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.89,0:15:59.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not the only one who will feel awful\Nwatching you suffer all on your own.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.90,0:16:13.93,Main,,0,0,0,,All of this is for what you truly desire.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.04,0:16:18.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What I desire is...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.66,0:16:21.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.40,0:16:24.25,Main,,0,0,0,,As first-born prince,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.25,0:16:28.82,Main,,0,0,0,,you must set an example for your younger brothers\Nand aim to become a king the people desire.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.42,0:16:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From a young age, my life revolved around\Nlearning everything that I needed to become king.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.50,0:16:39.84,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But one question popped into my mind...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.51,0:16:44.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What makes a "king the people desire"?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.07,0:16:46.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Royal Highness, Prince Leon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.20,0:16:47.92,Alt,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.82,0:16:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Royal Highness!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.46,0:16:49.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.28,0:16:53.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Highness Prince Leon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.12,0:16:54.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Crown Prince Leon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.91,0:16:55.79,Alt,,0,0,0,,Prince Leon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.87,0:16:59.83,Main,,0,0,0,,A king who continuously meets the people's desires.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.51,0:17:02.40,Main,,0,0,0,,That is the definitive answer.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.42,0:17:06.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was a spiritual awakening for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.14,0:17:10.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to be loved by the people.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.73,0:17:13.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want them to desire me. To covet me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.98,0:17:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not anyone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.82,0:17:16.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.78,0:17:20.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are dangerous thoughts, Brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.63,0:17:26.22,Main,,0,0,0,,They can be considered "attention-craving",\N"narcissistic", and "possessive".
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.71,0:17:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Such labels will harm your good reputation.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.20,0:17:35.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will never forget the shock of hearing\N my younger brother's criticism.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.32,0:17:40.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew I had to dispense with such distasteful emotions,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.72,0:17:44.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and temporarily refrained from even leaving the castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.08,0:17:48.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However... My body and soul still demanded it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.38,0:17:51.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.63,0:17:57.01,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, why not dedicate yourself to socializing with the members of high society?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.51,0:18:03.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I followed my brother's advice and tried to socialize\Nwith the young ladies around my age.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.55,0:18:07.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But then I noticed the feelings\N those ladies exhibited towards me were...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.77,0:18:09.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}attention-craving,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.65,0:18:11.53,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}narcissism,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.53,0:18:14.53,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and possessiveness.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.92,0:18:16.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It frightened me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.78,0:18:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was aghast to have once directed such horrible emotions\Ntowards the very populace I was meant to protect.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.48,0:18:29.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the end, I couldn't provide\N any of what they sought from me,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.10,0:18:32.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and the rumor that I was a womanizer spread.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.72,0:18:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What I desire is...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.21,0:18:44.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to be prince consort of the Kingdom of Freesia\Nand thereby bring peace to both of our kingdoms.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.97,0:18:48.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As a king, an older brother, and even as a human...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.50,0:18:50.84,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have proved inadequate.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.36,0:18:53.29,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is all I can really do.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.41,0:18:57.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.15,0:19:01.27,Main,,0,0,0,,About your engagement to Princess Pride...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.96,0:19:04.47,Main,,0,0,0,,It's possible that we may call the whole thing off.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.16,0:19:11.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to reach out to the Freesian queen\Nand prince consort again to discuss it further.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.61,0:19:17.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I am truly sorry for causing\N so much uncertainty in your life.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.68,0:19:26.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we are, Lady Jeanne and Lord Philip.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.84,0:19:30.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We will stand guard after we've carried the luggage inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.20,0:19:31.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.00,0:19:35.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hopefully, Prince Leon will keep his promise tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.24,0:19:42.12,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And everything will go smoothly with no commotion.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.06,0:19:52.66,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tomorrow, depending on the conversation between Father and the Queen of Freesia,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.66,0:19:57.46,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my engagement may be called off,\N bringing shame to the Kingdom of Anemone.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.01,0:20:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or if the engagement stays in place,\Ndespite the disrespect I showed the Kingdom of Freesia,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.85,0:20:08.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}then I will rarely ever set foot here again.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.30,0:20:11.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.18,0:20:13.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What happiness is there for me in any of this?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.66,0:20:25.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother. Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.43,0:20:30.02,Main,,0,0,0,,No one will recognize you if you wear this.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.72,0:20:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Please relax and get out of the castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.46,0:20:37.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We want your happiness above all else, Brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.46,0:20:39.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.98,0:20:42.14,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My desire right now is...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.92,0:20:46.23,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to leave the castle and mingle with the people.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.56,0:20:51.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's also what my younger brothers desire.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.27,0:20:57.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.72,0:20:59.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't do this, not tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.55,0:21:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Why not, Leon?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.52,0:21:05.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother, do you not wish to meet with the people?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.25,0:21:11.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You absolutely must not leave your castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.94,0:21:18.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Understood, Brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.81,0:21:23.47,Main,,0,0,0,,But seeing as how we brothers\N must sadly part ways soon,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.55,0:21:27.34,Main,,0,0,0,,will you allow us one last selfish wish?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.92,0:21:34.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Please partake in this gift,\Nto celebrate your engagement.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.06,0:21:37.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:50.03,0:21:51.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.79,0:21:53.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}am I here?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.69,0:23:32.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:\N From Villainess to Savior.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.52,0:23:37.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Episode 3: "The Cruel Queen and the Truth".
