Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.44,0:01:44.17,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\bord0\fad(150,150)}Every day's unique, you get one chance at it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.17,0:01:46.48,OP,,0,0,0,fx,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(150,150)\t(2160,2310,\1a&HFF&)}So you'd better make it count
